## Commandes PC1 — Dans l'ordre

### PowerShell Windows (admin) — une seule fois

```powershell
# Redirection ports Windows → WSL
netsh interface portproxy add v4tov4 listenport=8080 listenaddress=0.0.0.0 connectport=8080 connectaddress=172.22.141.234
netsh interface portproxy add v4tov4 listenport=8765 listenaddress=0.0.0.0 connectport=8765 connectaddress=172.22.141.234
netsh interface portproxy add v4tov4 listenport=9090 listenaddress=0.0.0.0 connectport=9090 connectaddress=172.22.141.234

# Firewall
netsh advfirewall firewall add rule name="QT8080" dir=in action=allow protocol=TCP localport=8080
netsh advfirewall firewall add rule name="QT8765" dir=in action=allow protocol=TCP localport=8765
```

### WSL — 5 terminaux à chaque démarrage

```bash
# Terminal 1 — Serveur C
cd ~/quantum_twin
./server 9090

# Terminal 2 — Proxy WebSocket
cd ~/quantum_twin
python3 proxy.py

# Terminal 3 — Serveur HTTP (page HTML)
cd ~/quantum_twin
python3 -m http.server 8080

# Terminal 4 — Tunnel WebSocket
cd ~
./cloudflared tunnel --url http://localhost:8765
# → note l'URL : https://XXXX.trycloudflare.com  (URL_WS)

# Terminal 5 — Tunnel HTTP
cd ~
./cloudflared tunnel --url http://localhost:8080
# → note l'URL : https://YYYY.trycloudflare.com  (URL_HTTP)
```

